==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~6 seconds<sup>2f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Take advantage of the peon spam at the beginning to build up money in your wallet. Once THE SLOTH and his helpers come out, let St. Pigge the 2nd and Celeboodle come close to the base, and unleash [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]. Fight your way to the enemy base with meatshields and ranged attackers, and send [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] to rush to the front lines as soon as you see THE SLOTH's attack animation. Repeat the process until THE SLOTH dies, and victory should be yours!

