==Trivia==
*Going along with the "risqué" theme of [[Risqué Terrain]], Enticing Tunnels' Japanese name is Dokidoki Ana (ドキドキ穴). ''Dokidoki'' is an onomatopoeia for a heart pounding, while ''Ana'' means "hole" or "pit". However, the kanji read as ''Ana'' (穴) also has another reading that is almost never actually used: ''ketsu'', meaning "buttocks".

